WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:03.530
- All right, we're going in here.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:05.299
- Oh! Hello.

00:00:05.299 --> 00:00:06.560
- Hello.
- Hello, how are you today?

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.610
- Good. How are you?

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:08.560
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.460
- Hi, nice to meet you, I'm Jerry.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.610
I like tarot cards. Do
you like tarot cards?

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.560
- Yeah, alright. Let's see tarot cards.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.127
You like getting a little tired?

00:00:17.127 --> 00:00:18.570
(laughing)

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.487
Can't hold the camera like you used to.

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:21.600
(laughing)

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.527
It's like, "Yeah I'll take the job.

00:00:22.527 --> 00:00:23.380
"But can I sit down?"

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:25.630
(laughing)

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.970
- Ah. This is looking good.

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.560
- You're strong-minded.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:31.810
When you set your mind to something

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:33.300
you have to follow it out.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.133
- Yes.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.598
- You analyze people
that are surrounding you.

00:00:36.598 --> 00:00:38.081
(cameraman laughing)

00:00:38.081 --> 00:00:40.157
(cellphone ringing)

00:00:40.157 --> 00:00:40.990
