00:00:41.823 --> 00:00:43.745
- [Jerry] It's not me.

00:00:43.745 --> 00:00:44.733
(laughing)

00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:46.413
- It's that spirit calling me.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:50.565
- They really are aggressive
these days, aren't they?

00:00:50.565 --> 00:00:51.585
- (laughing) Oh my!

00:00:51.585 --> 00:00:52.770
- They used to do it like, psychically.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:53.720
Now they just call.

